          "text": "The expanded mission and focus for A3PCON focusing on anti-Asian violence led to another name change which took place in 2021 so that A3PCON become the “AAPI Equity Alliance” to advocate for equity for all peoples.  In May of 2026, the organization that started as the “Lunch Bunch” celebrated its 50th anniversary with a gala that honored its past and looked to the future.  Also in 2026, the Alliance was renewed for another $30 million by the state to continue its work against APIA violence.  As they say, little acorns can become a large oak tree that can cast a large presence, and in this case, the impact is state-wide!"
