          "text": "The JACCC was completed in April 1980 and the nonprofit groups from the Sun Building were eagerly looking forward to occupying a brand-new office building with central heating and air conditioning.  They were shocked however when they found out they would have to pay rents in the new building which were triple what the groups were paying at the Sun Building!   This caused another round of heated community protests.  The conflict was eventually resolved when the LTCRA decided to provide substantial subsidies on the rents for the re-located groups for the first 5 years at the JACCC."
