          "text": "However, while EWP could capably produce amazing theater productions, it was difficult for them to raise the money for the renovation of the church.  As it is true with many live-theater groups, it was a constant struggle for EWP just to raise enough funds to put on shows and pay their actors and staff a modest salary.  After several years passed, the capital campaign project for the church renovation was not able to get off the ground."
