          "text": "I was acquainted with several board members of the EWP who relayed to me their difficulties in raising capital funds for the renovation costs.  After LTSC had completed the Firm Building project, I asked Lisa Sugino (then a new member of the LTSC staff) if she would do some digging into possible funding sources for the renovation of the abandoned church.  Within a couple of weeks Lisa informed me that she had uncovered a number of possible funding sources for the project that could help EWP to meet the costs of renovation.  This was exciting news which I wanted to share with EWP as encouragement for their renovation project."
